      "content": "Compare instants chronologically rather than lexicographically. The clock accepts ISO UTC strings with fractional seconds, whereas the session policy emits completion without them. For example, `2026-10-13T20:30:00.500Z` sorts before `2026-10-13T20:30:00Z`, so a save after session completion incorrectly returns `SessionNotCompleted`. Use `Temporal.Instant.compare(deps.clock.now(), day.completion) \u003c 0`, as the session policy itself does, and cover fractional-second clocks in a test.",
